\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 How much of the confession you read before interruption\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 You read three full pages before the candle gutters. Enough to understand the shape of it. 
\f2\fs26 has_manuscript +1, knowledge +1
\f1\fs24 \cell 
